Hi, friend!This is a game ready (Low Poly) model of an old rusty hatchback (1989). You can use this car in racing, fps, action game genres. Placing such a model will perfectly complement the level design whether it is an apocalyptic shooter or a destruction derby racing.It will also match a cyberpunk style levels as well due to non-rough surfaces with quality textures which reflect neon lights. There is quite a good detailing like radiators, window cleaners, side lights etc. I've tried to make the cleanest topology possible and you can see on wireframe renders this adorable square based polys.
You can use it not only in game design but also in CGI movie making as well!
Speaking about the polycount it is quite a low number so placing this vehicle on your scene will not influece on the optimization of your project much.
Total polycount: 7.278 faces!
